{"id":"1d04af639b3dad64","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CCompatible.md","title":"CCompatible","display":"CCompatible","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CCompatible","parameters":["U","R"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CCompatible"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>U</span><span>R</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>U</code>、<code>R</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CCompatible U R)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall a\n  (implies\n    (in a U)\n    (forall b\n      (implies\n        (in b U)\n        (implies\n          (@ Edge R a b)\n          (and\n            (forall x (forall y (implies (and (@ TBase x a) (@ TBase y b)) (= x y))))\n            (and\n              (not (exists x (exists y (exists z (and (@ TBase x a) (@ TArr y z b))))))\n              (and\n                (not (exists x (exists y (exists z (and (@ TArr x y a) (@ TBase z b))))))\n                (forall x\n                  (forall y\n                    (forall z (forall v (implies (and (@ TArr x y a) (@ TArr z v b)) (and (@ Edge R x z) (@ Edge R y v)))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f67326629fff1ce\" href=\"?note=2f67326629fff1ce\" title=\"ZFC_TArr\">TArr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b30f1eee99e1c728\" href=\"?note=b30f1eee99e1c728\" title=\"ZFC_TBase\">TBase</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CCompatible U R)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_TArr","status":"resolved","id":"2f67326629fff1ce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_TBase","status":"resolved","id":"b30f1eee99e1c728","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1371,"backlinks":[{"id":"80fb57ef7d250c19","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CCompatible|CCompatible]]"},{"id":"4c29bc243249e127","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_CCompatible|CCompatible]]；[[ZFC_CDependency|CDependency]]；[[ZFC_CNodes|CNodes]]；[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_EquivOn|EquivOn]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-502","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_CCompatible|CCompatible]]"},{"id":"f3184cdad9eb6fab","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CCompatible|CCompatible]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","abaf67a121eca170","2f67326629fff1ce","b30f1eee99e1c728","593f9bdab4d60707"]}